# This example shows the forced first interaction mode
# (edited by Andrea Frassà, 11/10/26)
#
# The first interaction of each primary gamma of the source MyForcedSource is
# forced to be a photo absorption (PHOT). Where it interacts is NOT changed,
# and all following interactions (and all secondaries) are analog.
# Allowed values: COMP, PHOT, PAIR, RAYL
#
# Each forced event contains a comment line:
# CC ForcedFirstInteraction <PrimaryID> <Forced> <OK|FAILED> <NaturalProcess> <Weight>
# with Weight = sigma_forced / sigma_total at the first interaction point


# Global parameters:
Version               1
Geometry              $(MEGALIB)/resource/examples/geomega/special/Spheric.geo.setup

# Physics list
PhysicsListEM                        LivermorePol

# Output formats
StoreSimulationInfo                  all



# Run: 10 MeV pencil beam, first interaction always a photo absorption

Run MyForcedRun
MyForcedRun.FileName                      ForcedFirstInteraction
MyForcedRun.Events                        10000

MyForcedRun.Source MyForcedSource
MyForcedSource.ParticleType               1
MyForcedSource.Beam                       FarFieldPointSource  0 0
MyForcedSource.Spectrum                   Mono 10000.0
MyForcedSource.Flux                       1.0
MyForcedSource.ForceFirstInteraction      PHOT
